    "title": "San Antonio's New Sweet Tooth Crawl Rallies 16 Bakeries for Saturday's Debut - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Javi Gonzalez ,\n11 hours ago Sixteen San Antonio bakeries are teaming up this Saturday, August 8, for the debut Sweet Tooth Crawl, a self-guided dessert tour built around a $13.54 passport card that participants fill with stickers as they sample treats around the city. The crawl launches from The Starlighter at 1910 Fredericksburg Rd. in the Deco District, and only passport holders will be eligible for the event's giveaways. Read full article\n1",
